SPEED_SLOW_PRE_PURGE_FOR_TPU MATERIAL=PLA

; --- Drop to first-layer height and prime a little
G0 Z0.15
G1 X134 E5 F300

; --- Begin modified L-shaped wipe ---

; 1) Horizontal long wipe from (130, 2) to (198, 2)
