; 2) Vertical move up from (200, -1.5) to (200, 4.5)
G1 Y4.5 E1 F800
M73 P2 R4

; 3) Small back move to relieve pressure
G1 X199.5 E-0.2

; 4) Vertical move down from (199.5, 4.5)
G1 Y-0.5 E0.7 F600

; 5) Horizontal return wipe from (199.5, -0.5) back to (130, 2.5)
G1 X130 E7.5 F600

SPEED_NORMAL__POST_PURGE_FOR_TPU MATERIAL=PLA

G1 Z0.1 F800
M73 P5 R4
G1 Y1 F1200

; --- End modified L-shaped wipe ---

; Lift clear of the front notch before the first travel. The purge ends at
; X130 Y1, and the first travel goes straight to the first object, so at
; Z0.1 it can cross the notch no-go region (x75-125, y0-34), which needs
; Z6 (C2 muon.m1-geometry v2, no_go.traverse_z).
